  "SAVE": "保存",
  "TOOL: Raise Heights\n\nDrag left click on the map ground to elevate terrain. Adjust size and strength in settings.": "工具：升高高度\n\n在地面上按住左键并拖动以提升地形。在设置中调整大小和强度。",
  "TOOL: Ramping\n\nLeft-click once on the terrain to set the Ramp Start Point. Left-click again to set the Ramp End Point. The tool will smoothly interpolate heights between the two points. Press Right-click or Escape to cancel.": "工具：斜坡绘制\n\n左键点击一下地形以设定斜坡起点，再次左键点击以设定终点。工具会在两点间平滑插值生成高度。右键或 Esc 键取消。",
  "TOOL: Lower Heights\n\nDrag left click on the map ground to depress terrain. Adjust size and strength in settings.": "工具：降低高度\n\n在地面上按住左键并拖动以降低地形。在设置中调整大小和强度。",
  "TOOL: Flatten Heights\n\nDrag left click to snap terrain heights toward the target Flatten Height slider value.": "工具：压平高度\n\n按住左键并拖动以将地形高度对齐到目标高度滑块的值。",
  "TOOL: Smooth Terrain\n\nDrag left click to average neighbor vertex heights and smooth out rugged elevations.": "工具：平滑地形\n\n按住左键并拖动以平均邻近顶点的高度，平整崎岖的地表。",
  "TOOL: Cliff / Terrace\n\nDrag left click to create flat terraced steps. Hold Shift to lower the target cliff level.": "工具：悬崖 / 阶地\n\n按住左键并拖动以创建平整的阶梯状地形。按住 Shift 键可降低悬崖目标高度。",
  "TOOL: Texture Painting\n\nDrag left click to paint texture layers onto the vertices of the terrain mesh.": "工具：纹理绘制\n\n按住左键并拖动以在地形网格的顶点上绘制纹理层。",
  "TOOL: Flood Fill\n\nClick once on the terrain map to flood-fill an area sharing the same texture color until hitting a boundary (cliff or different texture). Uses selected texture swatch.": "工具：油漆桶填充\n\n点击一次地面，可将具有相同颜色纹理的连通区域填充为选中的纹理，直到碰到悬崖或其他纹理边界。",
  "TOOL: Area Select\n\nDrag left click to select a rectangular area of the map. Press Ctrl+C to copy the area.": "工具：区域选择\n\n按住左键拖动以选择地图上的矩形区域。按 Ctrl+C 可复制该区域。",
  "TOOL: Area Paste\n\nClick on the terrain to paste the copied area. Use the Paste Contents Options checkboxes to filter what is pasted (Textures, Heights, Entities).": "工具：区域粘贴\n\n点击地面以粘贴复制的区域。使用“粘贴内容选项”复选框来过滤需要粘贴的内容（纹理、高度、实体）。",
  "TOOL: Place Unit\n\nLeft-click on the ground to spawn a {0} aligned with {1}.": "工具：放置单位\n\n左键点击地面以生成一个归属于 {1} 的 {0}。",
  "TOOL: Place Prop\n\nLeft-click on the ground to spawn static decorative object: {0}.": "工具：放置装饰物\n\n左键点击地面以生成静态装饰物件：{0}。",
  "TOOL: Clump Brush\n\nDrag left click on the ground to paint clumps of static props: {0} based on Density and Scale Variation settings. Uses texture brush shape (Circle/Square).": "工具：集群画刷\n\n按住左键并拖动以基于密度和缩放偏移设置绘制装饰组：{0}。使用纹理画刷形状（圆形/方形）。",
  "TOOL: Place Decal\n\nLeft-click on the ground to project a decorative decal. Snapping, scaling, and rotation apply.": "工具：放置贴花\n\n左键点击地面以投影一个装饰性贴花。应用网格对齐、缩放和旋转。",
  "TOOL: Object Eraser\n\nLeft-click directly on any unit or prop in 3D scene to erase and remove it from the map.": "工具：物件擦除\n\n在 3D 场景中直接左键点击任何单位或装饰物以将其从地图中删除。",
  "TOOL: Select / Move\n\nLeft-click directly on any unit, prop, or decal to select it. Hold and drag left click to move it. Use R to rotate, S to scale, or Delete/Backspace to delete.": "工具：选择 / 移动\n\n直接左键点击任何单位、装饰物或贴花以选中它。按住左键并拖动可移动它。使用 R 旋转、S 缩放，或使用 Delete/Backspace 键删除。",
  "TOOL: Eyedropper / Picker\n\nLeft-click directly on any unit, prop, or decal to copy and select it as the active placement tool. Click on terrain to copy its texture color, or hold Shift to copy its height.": "工具：取色器 / 吸管\n\n左键点击任何单位、装饰物或贴花以复制并将其设为当前放置工具。点击地形可复制其纹理颜色，按住 Shift 点击可复制其高度。",
  "TOOL: Roughen Terrain\n\nDrag left-click to apply random height variations/noise to ruggedize the terrain surface. Adjust size and strength in settings.": "工具：粗糙地形\n\n按住左键并拖动以向地面应用随机高度抖动/噪声，使地形起伏粗糙。可在设置中调整大小和强度。",
  "TOOL: Pathing Layer Painting\n\nDrag left click to paint pathing properties (ground, flying, water, etc.) onto the map. Use checkboxes to select layers, and Mode to Add/Remove.": "工具：绘制路径层\n\n按住左键并拖动以将通行属性（陆地、飞行、水域等）绘制到地图上。使用复选框选择图层，模式有添加/移除。",
